First diagram: the lower left object is typed $\Lambda_n/p^{n-i}\Lambda_n$, while the corresponding object in the second diagram reads $\Lambda_n/p^i\Lambda_n$. Both are transcribed as typed.
Big diagram, third row: the arrow 0 → $G(i+1)/p^{n-i-1}G(n)$ seems to have a double head and is rendered as twoheadrightarrow. Check this on the scan.
